{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "ef17a895-5292-8789-823a-c6f4fa46f384",
  "created_at": "2026-03-13T15:14:19-04:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Utilities",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Siobhan Sullivan",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Tony Ferreira",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-13T15:11:57-04:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Utilities billing, this is Tony. Good afternoon."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-13T15:12:00-04:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good afternoon, Tony, and I hope you are having a very good Friday. Thank you for taking my call. My name is Siobhan Sullivan."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-13T15:12:08-04:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Nice to meet you, Siobhan. What can I do for you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-13T15:12:12-04:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, so, I am a landlord, I have a rental property, and I am calling about the water and sewer bill. I do not want to take too much of your time."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-13T15:12:23-04:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem at all, take your time. What's going on with the bill?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-13T15:12:28-04:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Last month the city installed a new meter. A man came, he was very polite, he changed it in maybe twenty minutes. And now the bill arrived and, um, it looks off to me. It is much higher than I expect."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-13T15:12:41-04:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Is it higher than your usual bill, then?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-13T15:12:45-04:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, much higher. Last year, in the winter, the bills were much lower. Always about the same, very small. Now this one, it is a big jump, and nothing changed in the house. Same tenants, same everything."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-13T15:12:57-04:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. So that's one thing we see sometimes after a meter swap. The new meter might read differently than the old one did, and the old ones can read slow as they age. Also, the first bill after a change can cover part old meter, part new meter, so it can look odd."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-13T15:13:14-04:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Ah, I see. So it is possible it is correct, but it is also possible it is a mistake. Non lo so. That is Italian, I am learning Italian, sorry. I do not know."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-13T15:13:25-04:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No apology needed. Yeah, that's about where I am too, I can't tell you which from here. I'd want someone to look at the readings and the install date on your account."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-13T15:13:35-04:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, that is what I was hoping. Could someone please check, and then call me back with an answer? I am a little annoyed, to be honest, because I pay always on time."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-13T15:13:46-04:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. I'll send it over to the meter folks with a note that it's the first bill after a new install and that it's way above last winter. What's the best number to reach you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-13T15:13:57-04:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It is 401-555-0157. It is my cell phone, so if I do not answer, please leave a message. Grazie."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-13T15:14:04-04:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, 401-555-0157. And I'll note the name, Siobhan Sullivan. Someone should get back to you in the next few business days."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-13T15:14:12-04:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you very much, Tony. You are very kind. Have a beautiful weekend."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-13T15:14:17-04:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too, Siobhan. Take care."
    }
  ],
